msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/ST/ST_KAB0037.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0037.BIN::line:284_0_4"
msgid "I just said I'd seen you fighting here,{PA:10} but||he seemed like he was up to something.{PA:20}.{PA:20}.{PA:20}"
