msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/ST/ST_KAB0037.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0037.BIN::line:284_0_5"
msgid "He was just riding a normal bike,{PA:10} not like a||pimped out one,{PA:10} but he still seemed weird.{PA:20}"
